{"id": "clm:c4d66fdd9c98b8aea16e7d764254e8f59bd94c8527dcff3685f943031be00362", "type": "statement", "text": "The MongoDB server implementation README says defaultMaxTimeMS takes effect only when authentication is enabled. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)", "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/README_default_max_time_ms.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:ee1af3169a11f15454c7de2ade2be24985b21214298dfe78d96b514925a47545"]}
{"id": "clm:1f4b2dc332382285b802fee13b412624128222a29bbe4bf01c0f14602a33275f", "type": "statement", "text": "Because the implementation README assigns defaultMaxTimeMS the same semantics as maxTimeMS, interpret it as a server processing-time budget: termination occurs at designated interrupt points, client-to-server network latency is excluded, and mongos-to-mongod latency is included. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/README_default_max_time_ms.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/method/cursor.maxTimeMS.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:20d8405dc2140acbda376d91d6adf4e51d9ad2310498a60c8652006ef818be97", "ev:e2c7eebbbdfa12c8bae1c5f62ce3b5fbbacf0f1db611d29dd9208fa4b6129ef6"]}
{"id": "clm:eff5a508f83b5a30c7339f657c7c9b3fbae8ba520267a7835f8ae7debba4fc21", "type": "statement", "text": "Configure a five-second default on the admin database with db.adminCommand({setClusterParameter:{defaultMaxTimeMS:{readOperations:5000}}}); inspect it with db.adminCommand({getClusterParameter:\"defaultMaxTimeMS\"}). (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/cluster-parameters/defaultMaxTimeMS.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "how-to", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1d9c21754f8a642c4537790377beb8ea3f686ad7fc49587353a28ed98a5820a5", "ev:b42fc086972863fdb9040e4a0c6e862b5f654a1dca5fb6a4fdb2d9df43cd691a"]}
{"id": "clm:12154572359e04e1030ce8b98dbc1cfcbd3b15ba18fba077136f32c5c60a12fd", "type": "statement", "text": "MongoDB 8.0 introduced defaultMaxTimeMS.readOperations as a cluster-wide fallback time limit in milliseconds for individual read operations that omit maxTimeMS. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/cluster-parameters/defaultMaxTimeMS.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/mongodb/product-overview/features-of-mongodb-8-0", "https://www.mydbops.com/blog/unveiling-expected-features-in-mongodb-8-0"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:46569b7a6763d9771bb50f90d5c069b972cee1aee96fae3290454f82781289ad", "ev:4d4274bb0037b9dd32b3ac2cc707a6bfc46b6238623c4a04de3e89e70933a808"]}
{"id": "clm:347e5dc292a16f245c38e9a3f457bf09b4db41e13e3d1860162e19f7b7ad5d45", "type": "statement", "text": "defaultMaxTimeMS.readOperations defaults to 0, which supplies no default query timeout. It is not automatically a finite execution limit merely because the deployment uses MongoDB 8.0. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/cluster-parameters/defaultMaxTimeMS.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/README_default_max_time_ms.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:19cccaa88c5ef321b7d5f10ed4cdeae9bfd1f3f03724171c78d37a1a997454f8", "ev:f396f783a5b8db670e4ba1b05432da5526d04d98fe01330ecfefe6d4c818cfb4"]}
{"id": "clm:276b4c6a3115be70a42de0a5eb47be7e298e77987e683db2977cdd2b6fdb4f68", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas describes this timeout as a last-round mitigation that cancels overlong operations and limits resource retention; Tencent likewise identifies resource exhaustion prevention as its purpose. This is execution-time protection rather than a prediction that a query will be expensive. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/resilient-application.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://cloud.tencent.com/document/product/240/125902"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:bc747973978ef287e7e65f73fefd14714fa7219b494239f4ba221106ae8d6e0c", "ev:dfd30d8185cf0f51a566c03c31c46623b09f93645a17013996f1087103e5c6d3"]}
{"id": "clm:eccecf66799374a6e781ba269dccca9f81e695be1387d9b56ad7e5786357739f", "type": "statement", "text": "The implementation README says users with bypassDefaultMaxTimeMS ignore the default, and root and __system have that privilege by default. Verify enforcement with the application identity rather than only an administrative identity. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)", "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/README_default_max_time_ms.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:8a7db6f9229d3099c421f050639a54a18809a788ea51720828e8326c86a40170"]}
{"id": "clm:6bdfdd1e09eb8f2d22f23f14d49e24fbfa2ee38db2a738697316baf9610132dd", "type": "statement", "text": "MongoDB Atlas documents defaultMaxTimeMS as mitigation for expensive queries, including collection scans from missing indexes; database teams can set the fallback centrally rather than rely on every application to set a timeout. Mydbops independently describes the same operational use. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/resilient-application.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mydbops.com/blog/unveiling-expected-features-in-mongodb-8-0"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:900d8dcce6311d1eb3d71a561aa97ca936ee2d33392714202221ef675e510116", "ev:bc747973978ef287e7e65f73fefd14714fa7219b494239f4ba221106ae8d6e0c"]}
{"id": "clm:94e3f046252fe3581a43b37374a21e9551cd01178cf86ab0fc6d62b2d28f777d", "type": "statement", "text": "Supported reads are find, count, distinct, dbHash, and aggregate without $out or $merge. Aggregations containing either write stage do not inherit this default, although an explicit maxTimeMS can still apply. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/cluster-parameters/defaultMaxTimeMS.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/mongodb/product-overview/features-of-mongodb-8-0", "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/README_default_max_time_ms.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3cb1bcd13418130630ec53c6d9b19f29f0c3c31f55637f79880f03b356bc1d3b", "ev:a67ce68b1a5f9a9582ba0c60676068ad34dbaf141a59fdeed392d1f5faebc446"]}
{"id": "clm:ced5839ee8b7edb5fbbd0b4ea9879c8b9772ff2ae33bf5724b4d1d214b2a150c", "type": "statement", "text": "An explicit operation-level maxTimeMS overrides the cluster default, including a longer timeout for legitimate analytics work; the setting therefore is not a mandatory upper bound on every read. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/cluster-parameters/defaultMaxTimeMS.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/resilient-application.md", "https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/mongodb/product-overview/features-of-mongodb-8-0"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:9fc8329c2b1f1e9d8ae88879eebeb6a7ec912808a1a36854b115873cc8154297", "ev:b16f9fa515a11201e460917916d7e75540aa7af78298f1ac2d1938a7f5e47b4e"]}
{"id": "clm:62f53a519a5b77ddffccbaefc0987ccaf3e171ff15e8839d32bfc304797ccebb", "type": "statement", "text": "The MongoDB server implementation README says defaultMaxTimeMS has an effect only with authentication enabled. Users granted bypassDefaultMaxTimeMS ignore the default; root and __system include that privilege by default. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)", "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/README_default_max_time_ms.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:54b9504a5137e8e5f185dcbeb746c5ebbad3400b7792601f10b90f2d479f7a15"]}
{"id": "clm:4a32bdc827bde9e1984ca741b8171bab1c6255ef98e08fd3adfd3bfc2f3b97fb", "type": "statement", "text": "DRIVERS-3474 reports that timeoutMS=0 in a mongosh URI does not override defaultMaxTimeMS, whereas explicit maxTimeMS(0) does. Its July 22, 2026 update describes the Node.js driver's infinite client timeout as not emitting a server maxTimeMS override and leaves the spec change unresolved. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-07-22)", "source_url": "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/DRIVERS-3474", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0e4fec53b7c003e36668cfd5627c00c63dee9f50ebbdf39198638303e2666758", "ev:501ae24aba1d57419b1a10099bf60c5dba268c5ac48830d6df382d3a5199133f"]}
{"id": "clm:d53f86126e5f4e6cfa4ba3b50f3cf7a9bcfbbc478405b24ce578c815a869d85c", "type": "statement", "text": "Crossplane's provider-mongodbatlas v1.6.0 API, published October 22, 2026, exposes optional DefaultMaxTimeMs with JSON name defaultMaxTimeMs and Terraform name default_max_time_ms, showing a declarative configuration surface for the setting. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-22)", "source_url": "https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/crossplane-contrib/provider-mongodbatlas/apis/namespaced/mongodbatlas/v1alpha2", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:30839032a7f533e8d5d0e7a84bb1f93c064a28013080573a74d3b9c60a11989b", "ev:c6ff63f22bbe9bb0aba3f68a997f7fd808f9d0f38f49859b79f1a4fd564b6765"]}
{"id": "clm:d227ab98ca95574470bc6bd7f7ea517d3af12544e6fd4d34ecfd51ee2049b237", "type": "statement", "text": "The implementation README says commands exceeding defaultMaxTimeMS return MaxTimeMSExpired. This is an execution timeout, not a guarantee that the operation is rejected before execution begins. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/README_default_max_time_ms.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["defaultMaxTimeMS cluster-level read timeout"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e41a1d5a132ffa0fcb31ad53a905b98f5fd91ce0afbb6ee7a588e711bc01a963", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:e2c7eebbbdfa12c8bae1c5f62ce3b5fbbacf0f1db611d29dd9208fa4b6129ef6"]}
